[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0879","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0879.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0600","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9122,\"outputTokens\":19,\"totalTokens\":10805}}","description":"某网络入侵检测系统（IDS）存在安全漏洞，其根本原因在于系统在处理网络数据包时未对数据包的校验和（checksum）进行验证。攻击者可利用此缺陷构造带有错误校验和的特制数据包，这类数据包会被目标主机的协议栈丢弃，但仍能被 IDS 接收并解析，从而造成 IDS 与真实主机对流量的理解不一致。未经身份认证的远程攻击者借此可绕过入侵检测机制，使恶意流量逃避监控，或注入伪造数据干扰检测结果，进而掩盖后续攻击行为。该漏洞无需任何认证凭证，仅需向受监控网络发送数据包即可触发，影响范围覆盖所有未做校验和验证的网络入侵检测系统，CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0600"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:42Z","remediation":"在网络入侵检测系统（IDS）的配置中启用并强制校验数据包 IP/TCP 校验和（checksum），丢弃校验和错误的伪造或篡改报文；升级到已修复该缺陷的 IDS 厂商版本（如 Snort 1.6 及以上、ISS RealSecure 最新补丁），并在边界部署状态化防火墙对异常分片与伪造流量进行过滤，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.robertgraham.com/mirror/Ptacek-Newsham-Evasion-98.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/64fd197c5b8f3e4f9493cb07798bdca54583505c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0600.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0600","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0600.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f71c1815da5fc1872d1d999eebe8b28a9e3854c7/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0600.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2e86ccb45bad26f6ff984e676f6d08b925d0e6ee/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9m27-cjg7-pj49/GHSA-9m27-cjg7-pj49.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0600.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0600.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/eadba179b68570c488f1a812e4ac71e19ff05906/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0879.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0874","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0874.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0597","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":16280,\"outputTokens\":37,\"totalTokens\":16317}}","description":"Windows NT 系统的账户策略存在安全配置缺陷，当远程用户的登录时段（logon hours）到期后，系统并不会强制断开其已建立的远程会话连接。受影响的系统为配置了登录时间限制的 Windows NT 服务器，远程攻击者只需在允许时段内成功登录并建立会话，即可在授权时段结束后继续保持连接，绕过登录时间限制策略，持续访问服务器资源。该漏洞源于系统未对过期会话执行强制断开机制，攻击者无需特殊权限或额外工具即可利用，属于配置与策略强制执行层面的安全问题，CVSS 评分达到 10.0 的最高危险等级。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0597"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:42Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 6a 或更高版本（含修复补丁 Q244366），或应用微软安全公告 MS99-025 对应补丁。临时缓解：在用户管理器中启用\"强制注销已过期登录时间\"策略，或部署登录脚本定时强制断开过期会话。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1343","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8cc4bd87e08227d0a597e9249036a66efd1a35dd/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0597.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0597","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0597.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5bae259b1f96bb239cbfd83cd9b28dd6d9df406/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0597.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2e86ccb45bad26f6ff984e676f6d08b925d0e6ee/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v2p7-wqpp-8h67/GHSA-v2p7-wqpp-8h67.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0597.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000446.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0597.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/76602871db1ff432e52b5609a116b2a5bc6fffe2/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0874.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0872","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0872.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0596","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9111,\"outputTokens\":17,\"totalTokens\":10792}}","description":"Windows NT 系统的日志记录功能存在安全配置缺陷，其日志文件被设置为不适当的最大容量上限或日志保留周期，导致关键安全事件日志在达到上限后被覆盖或过早清除，无法完整记录攻击者的操作痕迹。该漏洞影响采用默认或不当日志策略的 Windows NT 系统，攻击条件为攻击者需已获得系统访问权限或利用其他漏洞进入系统，通过触发大量日志写入耗尽日志空间，使后续入侵行为难以被审计追溯，从而降低被发现和取证的概率。此问题属于安全配置不当类弱点，可通过调整日志最大大小与保留策略加以缓解。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0596"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:42Z","remediation":"升级到受支持的 Windows Server 版本（如 Windows Server 2022）以消除此历史配置缺陷。对于仍需运行 Windows NT 的系统，通过事件查看器（Event Viewer）分别设置应用程序日志、系统日志和安全日志的最大大小至合理值（建议不小于 10MB），并在日志属性中配置适当的覆盖策略，选择\"按需要覆盖事件\"或\"归档日志文件后覆盖事件\"以防止日志无限增长耗尽磁盘空间。同时启用自动日志归档功能，定期将日志备份至独立存储介质，确保安全事件日志满足合规审查要求。建议在网络边界部署集中式日志管理系统（如 SIEM），将所有服务器日志统一收集存储，避免单台服务器磁盘被日志占满导致服务中断。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2577","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8cc4bd87e08227d0a597e9249036a66efd1a35dd/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0596.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0596","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0596.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5bae259b1f96bb239cbfd83cd9b28dd6d9df406/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0596.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2e86ccb45bad26f6ff984e676f6d08b925d0e6ee/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x2q8-w843-gwx7/GHSA-x2q8-w843-gwx7.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0596.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0596.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/76602871db1ff432e52b5609a116b2a5bc6fffe2/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0872.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0870","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0870.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0593","title":"微软 Windows NT 身份验证绕过漏洞","description":"Windows NT 系统的 Winlogon 注册表项中存在名为 ShutdownWithoutLogon 的默认配置，该配置允许尚未登录系统的用户在登录界面直接执行关机操作。此配置缺陷属于本地物理安全策略不当，影响范围覆盖默认安装的 Windows NT 操作系统。攻击条件为攻击者需具备对目标主机的物理访问权限（如可直接操作键盘、鼠标或电源按钮），利用方式是在登录屏幕未认证状态下通过界面触发关机，从而绕过正常登录审计流程，造成服务中断与本地防护绕过，可能被用于规避日志记录或配合其他物理攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.9,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0593"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:41Z","remediation":"在 Windows NT 注册表编辑器中定位到 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Winlogon，将 ShutdownWithoutLogon 键值从 1 修改为 0，重启后生效。此配置可禁止未登录用户通过物理访问关闭系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/59333","http://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/library/cc722469.aspx","http://www.microsoft.com/technet/archive/winntas/deploy/confeat/06wntpcc.mspx?mfr=true","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1291","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8cc4bd87e08227d0a597e9249036a66efd1a35dd/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0593.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0593","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0593.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5bae259b1f96bb239cbfd83cd9b28dd6d9df406/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0593.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2e86ccb45bad26f6ff984e676f6d08b925d0e6ee/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3jjv-7mh3-jr9j/GHSA-3jjv-7mh3-jr9j.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x87000/86243/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0593.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153200_153300.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0870.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0869","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0869.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0592","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 登录用户信息泄露漏洞","description":"Windows NT 系统的登录对话框默认显示上一次成功登录的用户名，导致本地攻击者可通过物理访问目标系统获取有效账户信息。该漏洞属于信息泄露类型，攻击者利用获取的用户名可进一步实施密码猜测或暴力破解攻击，降低系统安全性。此漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 及更早版本，无需特殊权限即可利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0592"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:41Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 6a 或更高版本（如 Windows 2000），微软在 SP6a 中修复了此漏洞。若无法立即升级，可通过组策略“交互式登录：不显示最后的用户名”设置为“已启用”来禁用登录框显示上次登录用户名，或修改注册表 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Winlogon\\DontDisplayLastUserName 设为 1 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1353","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8cc4bd87e08227d0a597e9249036a66efd1a35dd/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0592.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0592","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0592.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3a7f9488e77673498ec37285be0a165ad71720f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0592.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2a2be81fd4b47dc35d815a995b6429bd116a3b84/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6cjr-f6hr-x67r/GHSA-6cjr-f6hr-x67r.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0592.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0592.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/76602871db1ff432e52b5609a116b2a5bc6fffe2/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0869.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0865","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0865.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0591","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 事件日志访问权限不当远程安全漏洞","description":"Windows NT 系统的事件日志（Event Log）配置了不恰当的访问控制权限，导致权限设置过于宽松。该漏洞影响运行 Windows NT 操作系统的服务器与工作站，攻击者只需具备本地或远程的普通用户访问权限，即可读取、篡改或清除系统安全事件日志，从而掩盖其入侵痕迹、破坏审计完整性，并可能借此获取系统配置与用户活动等敏感信息。利用方式通常为直接访问事件日志文件或调用相关 API，绕过应有的安全限制，造成日志机密性与完整性受损。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0591"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:41Z","remediation":"安装 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 6a 或更高版本安全更新，修复事件日志默认权限配置不当问题。如无法安装补丁，通过 regedt32 将注册表项 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\EventLog 的权限限制为仅 Administrators 和 SYSTEM 完全控制，并确保 %SystemRoot%\\System32\\config\\*.evt 文件权限仅允许 Administrators 组读写。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0591","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8cc4bd87e08227d0a597e9249036a66efd1a35dd/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0591.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0591","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0591.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3a7f9488e77673498ec37285be0a165ad71720f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0591.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2a2be81fd4b47dc35d815a995b6429bd116a3b84/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j448-c6cm-wxq3/GHSA-j448-c6cm-wxq3.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/1999/CVE-1999-0591.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x87000/86255/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0591.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0865.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0862","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0862.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0589","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9108,\"outputTokens\":19,\"totalTokens\":10791}}","description":"Windows NT 系统存在注册表权限配置不当的安全漏洞。系统中某关键注册表项的访问控制列表（ACL）配置错误，导致未经身份认证的远程攻击者可能通过多种方式（如空会话连接、SMB 协议等）获取对该注册表项的写入或修改权限。攻击者可利用此漏洞篡改系统级配置信息，进而提升自身权限、禁用安全服务或进行其他恶意操作，完全绕过原有的访问控制机制。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 及早期基于 Windows NT 内核的系统，CVSS 评分高达 10.0，危害等级为严重。建议管理员立即使用注册表编辑器（regedt32）检查并修复相关注册表项的权限配置，严格限制可访问该关键注册表项的用户和组，仅赋予系统管理员必要的读取权限，避免授予写入或完全控制权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0589"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:41Z","remediation":"Windows NT 已停止支持，建议立即升级至 Windows Server 2019/2022 或更高版本。若无法升级，使用 regedt32 检查并收紧关键注册表项（如 HKLM\\SAM、HKLM\\SECURITY、HKLM\\SYSTEM）的权限，移除 Everyone 和 Users 组的完全控制权，仅保留 SYSTEM 和 Administrators 的完全控制权。应用 Microsoft 安全配置工具（SCE）或自定义安全模板（.inf）批量修复注册表 ACL。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0589","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/1999/CVE-1999-0589.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/35cd604fbbf2927fb6acbcd700e81d36cd6dec11/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0589.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0589","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3a7f9488e77673498ec37285be0a165ad71720f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0589.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0589.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2a2be81fd4b47dc35d815a995b6429bd116a3b84/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2h9f-vc99-85c4/GHSA-2h9f-vc99-85c4.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/smb_reg_hklm.nasl","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0589.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/smb_reg_schedule.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0862.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0859","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0859.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0587","title":"开源应用 WWW 服务器文件系统信息泄露漏洞","description":"该漏洞源于 OpenSource Application 的 WWW 服务器未能在受限制的文件系统中运行（如未使用 chroot 实现）。攻击者无需身份验证即可直接访问服务器的文件系统，这导致攻击者能够浏览和获取系统内所有关键文件和敏感信息，如配置文件、密码数据库、账号凭证等。受影响系统涵盖各种运行 OpenSource Application 的 Web 服务器，由于此类服务器广泛应用于众多企业和机构，因此整体影响范围极大。攻击者仅需向目标服务器发送简单 HTTP 请求即可触发漏洞，操作简单且风险较低，适合大规模扫描利用。攻击者通过获取系统关键文件，可进一步获取权限提升、利用其他漏洞、破坏系统完整性等高级恶意行为。该漏洞因其极端危害性获得 CVSS 满分 10.0 分，被列为严重安全事件，亟需系统重新构建安全沙箱环境，确保 Web 服务隔离和文件系统安全控制。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0587"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:41Z","remediation":"将Web服务器进程限制在chroot jail或容器环境中运行，配置DocumentRoot限制文档根目录，禁用FollowSymLinks选项防止目录遍历，以最小权限用户（如www-data）运行Web服务进程，禁用不必要的模块（如mod_autoindex），配置open_basedir限制PHP脚本访问路径，部署WAF规则阻断目录遍历攻击Payload（如../等），定期审计Web目录权限确保最小权限原则。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0587","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/35cd604fbbf2927fb6acbcd700e81d36cd6dec11/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0587.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0587","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0587.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3a7f9488e77673498ec37285be0a165ad71720f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0587.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2a2be81fd4b47dc35d815a995b6429bd116a3b84/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w7xx-5rj3-rrrc/GHSA-w7xx-5rj3-rrrc.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0587.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x87000/86250/info.html","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000443.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--eccf97d2-38b3-43a5-bc13-280cb22967b1.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0859.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0848","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0848.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0581","title":"微软 Windows NT 注册表 HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT 权限配置不当漏洞","description":"Windows NT 系统的 HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT 注册表根键被配置了不恰当的、涉及系统关键的访问权限。该注册表项存放着文件类型关联、COM 组件及 OLE 对象等关键系统配置，正常应仅允许管理员修改。由于权限设置过于宽松，本地已登录的普通用户或低权限用户可对该项及其子项进行写入、修改甚至删除操作。攻击者在具备本地登录权限的条件下，可通过 regedit 等工具或调用注册表 API 篡改关联的程序路径或 COM 对象，进而实现权限提升、持久化驻留或破坏系统稳定性，影响所有受此错误权限配置影响的 Windows NT 系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0581"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:40Z","remediation":"重置 HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT 注册表项的访问控制列表为默认权限：仅 Administrators 组和 SYSTEM 账户拥有完全控制权限，Users 组和 Everyone 仅保留读取权限。可使用 regini.exe 工具通过注册表配置文件批量修复，命令为：regini fix_hkcr_perms.txt，其中配置文件内容为 \\HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT 1 [administrators 全控] [system 全控] [users 读取] [everyone 读取]。若无法立即修复，可将注册表项权限导出备份后通过 regedit 手动修改，并在防火墙和组策略中限制对注册表的远程访问。建议升级到受支持的 Windows 版本以彻底消除此漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0581","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/1999/CVE-1999-0581.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/770e8f09ce14e637a09c7c619e10772aa6172bea/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0581.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0581","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e1298ff7aafe81b936ca67ecef34c3124d6c72f0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0581.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0581.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2a2be81fd4b47dc35d815a995b6429bd116a3b84/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3rwh-j2p9-wp9q/GHSA-3rwh-j2p9-wp9q.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0581.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x87000/86236/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153100_153200.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0848.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0845","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0845.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0579","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 注册表审核策略日志记录缺失漏洞","description":"Windows NT 系统的注册表审核策略存在缺陷，对非关键注册表键值的访问操作（无论成功或失败）均不会记录审核事件日志。攻击者可利用此缺陷在不留下审计痕迹的情况下修改非关键注册表键值，潜在地篡改系统配置或植入恶意配置，从而规避安全审计机制的检测。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 系列操作系统，CVSS 评分 10.0，属于严重级别的审计绕过漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0579"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:40Z","remediation":"在 Windows NT 中打开注册表编辑器 regedt32，进入\"安全\"→\"审核\"，为 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM、SOFTWARE 等非关键注册表项添加\"成功\"与\"失败\"的审核项；同时运行 regedt32 中\"选项\"→\"审核\"确保已启用注册表审核策略。将域控制器与重要服务器加入域安全策略强制开启审计，并定期审阅安全日志，无法立即配置时限制远程注册表访问（禁用 Remote Registry 服务）作为缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/228","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/770e8f09ce14e637a09c7c619e10772aa6172bea/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0579.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0579","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0579.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e1298ff7aafe81b936ca67ecef34c3124d6c72f0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0579.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2a2be81fd4b47dc35d815a995b6429bd116a3b84/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fvqx-8235-38mw/GHSA-fvqx-8235-38mw.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0579.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x87000/86238/info.html","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000442.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/zephyros1603/RadiantProcessors/blob/7d44cb1cd4b9e088fbe463f1b19be50a04c2efe8/Backend/RAG/data/allitems.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0845.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0843","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0843.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0577","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9105,\"outputTokens\":17,\"totalTokens\":10786}}","description":"Windows NT 系统的文件审计策略存在安全配置缺陷，对于非关键文件或目录，系统不会记录访问成功或失败的事件日志。攻击者在已获得目标系统访问权限的情况下，可借此对敏感但被标记为\"非关键\"的文件或目录进行未授权读取、修改或删除操作，而其行为不会触发任何审计告警，从而规避安全监控与事后溯源。该漏洞影响启用了文件审计策略但未正确配置关键路径的 Windows NT 系统，CVSS 评分达 10.0，危害等级极为严重。利用方式主要为本地或低权限攻击者通过操纵审计策略绕过日志监控实施隐蔽攻击，修复建议是正确配置审计策略，将重要文件与目录纳入审计范围并启用成功与失败事件的双重记录。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0577"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:40Z","remediation":"在 Windows NT 的「本地安全策略」→「审核策略」中启用「审核对象访问」的成功和失败审核，然后对关键目录（如系统目录、敏感数据目录）应用审核条目，在 ACL 高级设置中添加 Everyone 组的「完全控制」审核。对于 Windows 2000 及以上版本，建议升级操作系统以获取更完善的审核功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0577","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/770e8f09ce14e637a09c7c619e10772aa6172bea/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0577.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0577","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0577.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e1298ff7aafe81b936ca67ecef34c3124d6c72f0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0577.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2a2be81fd4b47dc35d815a995b6429bd116a3b84/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p3j3-4263-vqh3/GHSA-p3j3-4263-vqh3.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0577.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x87000/86044/info.html","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000440.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d07355ed-bbf5-4784-ac55-957a53c7d6f5.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0843.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0836","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0836.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0571","title":"ZyXEL Prestige 路由器 管理接口未授权访问漏洞","description":"这是一个影响 ZyXEL Prestige 路由器的管理和配置服务漏洞。该路由的管理界面（包括 Web 管理界面或 Telnet 服务）配置不当，允许来自任意网络的未授权连接。攻击者无需身份验证即可访问路由器的管理服务，能够进行配置修改、查看网络状态或执行其他管理操作，从而可能导致路由设备被完全控制，网络安全架构被破坏，甚至成为进一步攻击的跳板。此类漏洞影响于支持远程管理的网络设备，攻击者可通过网络直接对路由进行非法操作，危害网络基础设施安全。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0571"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:39Z","remediation":"升级 ZyXEL Prestige 路由器固件至最新版本，建议开启访问控制列表 (ACL) 仅允许特定 IP 访问管理接口，并关闭不必要的服务如 Telnet，使用强密码并启用 HTTPS 管理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0571","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/abfccbe3a11aa2b9dde2cfba5a12ba6256820a51/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0571.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0571","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0571.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ed6bb242e8dd7e27b54cbf189349b0ad2ae7c304/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0571.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/zyxel_pwd.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/780ea229276a503f17a45c7ccc9fc5e26e6b2447/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c7jg-hmf3-2v5x/GHSA-c7jg-hmf3-2v5x.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0571.json","https://github.com/LubyRuffy/plugins/blob/f873b19f27c95eaf2993ca4acde5cb7965d2ee3f/pre2008/zyxel_http_pwd.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0836.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0835","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0835.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0570","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":16244,\"outputTokens\":31,\"totalTokens\":16275}}","description":"Windows NT 操作系统未启用密码过滤器实用程序（如 PASSFILT.DLL），导致系统未对账户密码的强度与复杂度进行强制校验。该漏洞影响所有未配置密码过滤器的 Windows NT 域控制器与成员服务器，攻击条件为本地或远程获得账户创建/修改权限的攻击者。利用方式为攻击者可为账户设置弱口令、空口令或字典易猜密码，从而绕过密码策略并提升暴力破解与未授权登录的成功率，严重威胁系统身份安全。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0570"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:39Z","remediation":"为 Windows NT 安装并启用密码过滤实用程序（如微软 PASSFILT.DLL），将其配置到系统密码策略中强制复杂密码；通过「管理工具→域用户管理器→策略→密码策略」勾选\"密码必须符合复杂性要求\"并应用。同时启用账户锁定策略，限制口令尝试次数，并以最小权限原则限制可修改账户策略的用户，作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabiliti