iation":"升级到 Solaris 2.6 最新补丁簇或 Solaris 7 及以上版本，并安装 Sun 官方安全补丁（如 105396 系列）。同时修改 /etc/inetd.conf，将 rpc.admind 配置为以安全模式运行（添加 -s 参数），或通过防火墙限制 100232 端口仅允许可信内网访问，禁用不必要的 RPC 服务以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0568","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/abfccbe3a11aa2b9dde2cfba5a12ba6256820a51/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0568.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0568","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0568.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ed6bb242e8dd7e27b54cbf189349b0ad2ae7c304/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0568.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/780ea229276a503f17a45c7ccc9fc5e26e6b2447/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5pmv-f82w-3v96/GHSA-5pmv-f82w-3v96.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0568.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/zephyros1603/RadiantProcessors/blob/7d44cb1cd4b9e088fbe463f1b19be50a04c2efe8/Backend/RAG/data/allitems.txt","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/mega-foss/blob/4829eeb7b0101570abbc87d2a697f2c0c2f4e5c3/src/cve/graphql/trial.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/763b4dfa75aa1890a155aad1b583fdcab8111c49/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0568.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0831.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0828","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0828.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0565","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":10368,\"inputTokens\":407,\"outputTokens\":17,\"totalTokens\":10792}}","description":"Sendmail 邮件传输代理存在别名配置漏洞，攻击者可通过构造包含管道符（|）的别名文件条目，将邮件输入直接传递给任意系统命令执行。该漏洞影响早期版本的 Sendmail 系统，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可在运行 Sendmail 的服务器上执行任意命令，获得服务器控制权。攻击者需能够向 Sendmail 别名文件写入或修改内容，进而通过邮件投递触发命令执行，最终可能导致系统被完全入侵，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0565"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:38Z","remediation":"升级 Sendmail 到 8.9.3 或更高版本以修复别名管道执行漏洞。如无法立即升级，应在 sendmail.cf 中设置 DontBlameSendmail=no 或删除 /etc/aliases 中所有含管道符 \"|\" 的别名条目，并将 alias 文件权限设为只有 root 可读写（chmod 644 /etc/aliases），同时使用 /etc/sendmail.cw 限制中继域名，减少攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0565","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/1999/CVE-1999-0565.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/abfccbe3a11aa2b9dde2cfba5a12ba6256820a51/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0565.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0565","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2a20296d4b03dbd5c5991115b8296a9f2b947592/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0565.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0565.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/780ea229276a503f17a45c7ccc9fc5e26e6b2447/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6pqr-5mv4-2r65/GHSA-6pqr-5mv4-2r65.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0565.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x87000/86048/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153100_153200.json"],"poc_urls":[],"ex